English Proficiency Requirements.content:
Applicants have to fulfill English Language requirements with ONE of the following proficiency attainments:
1. With TOEFL score in minimum **80** for tests taken prior to 21 January 2026 or **4.5** for tests taken from 21 January 2026 onwards (iBT); **550** (pBT) or **60** (Revised paper-delivered test);
2. With IELTS (Academic Module) overall score in minimum **6.5** (and ALL sub-scores in **5.5** or above);
3. First language is English;
4. The bachelor's degree (or equivalent) was awarded from an institution where the medium of instruction was English.
Click [HERE](https://fytgs.hkust.edu.hk/cgi-bin/pg/eng/detail.php?catid=3&sid=8&tid=35) for more information.
